# Build output and local state must never enter the image: a stale bin/ from the
# host can silently shadow the container build, and a committed .db would ship
# someone's uploaded data inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.idea/
.claude/

# NOTE: docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored — BudgetGuard.Web compiles
# docs/DETECTION_METHODOLOGY.md into the image and renders it on the
# "How this works" page.
tests/
**/TestResults/

**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
README.md
*.md
